{"meta":{"format_version":"4.10","model_format":"free","box_uv":false},"name":"stone_blocks","model_identifier":"stone_blocks","visible_box":[1,1,0],"variable_placeholders":"","variable_placeholder_buttons":[],"timeline_setups":[],"unhandled_root_fields":{"description":"## stone_blocks\n\nCarried load, made goods.\n\n- Cubes: 2 (0 rotated). Texture 32x32, 1 px per unit, embedded.\n- Bounds at rest: x -4.0..4.0, y -3.0..4.5, z -7.5..-0.5 (size 8.0 x 7.5 x 7.0 u = 22 x 21 x 20 cm).\nStone blocks: two squared, dressed building stones (~25 cm) stacked in the arms, chisel-edged with darker arrises. Origin = **slot_carry** (front of the chest): the load sits in both arms, its back face at z = 0 against the chest and its underside at the forearms. To stand it on the ground as a pile/prop, place the origin at y = 3.0.\n"},"description":"## stone_blocks\n\nCarried load, made goods.\n\n- Cubes: 2 (0 rotated). Texture 32x32, 1 px per unit, embedded.\n- Bounds at rest: x -4.0..4.0, y -3.0..4.5, z -7.5..-0.5 (size 8.0 x 7.5 x 7.0 u = 22 x 21 x 20 cm).\nStone blocks: two squared, dressed building stones (~25 cm) stacked in the arms, chisel-edged with darker arrises. Origin = **slot_carry** (front of the chest): the load sits in both arms, its back face at z = 0 against the chest and its underside at the forearms. To stand it on the ground as a pile/prop, place the origin at y = 3.0.\n","resolution":{"width":32,"height":32},"elements":[{"name":"block_0","box_uv":false,"rescale":false,"locked":false,"light_emission":0,"render_order":"default","allow_mirror_modeling":true,"from":[-4.0,-3.0,-7.5],"to":[4.0,1.0,-0.5],"autouv":0,"color":0,"inflate":0.0,"origin":[0.0,0.0,0.0],"faces":{"north":{"uv":[0,7,8.0,11.0],"texture":0},"east":{"uv":[16,7,23.0,11.0],"texture":0},"south":{"uv":[8,7,16.0,11.0],"texture":0},"west":{"uv":[23,7,30.0,11.0],"texture":0},"up":{"uv":[0,0,8.0,7.0],"texture":0},"down":{"uv":[8,0,16.0,7.0],"texture":0}},"type":"cube","uuid":"19364ce4-2678-575e-946b-f02762e594